{"ts":"2026-07-11T11:10:40.136Z","author":"codex-native-plugin-research","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-95d7"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Align pm-codex with native ChatGPT/Codex plugin and Apps SDK contracts"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Harden the shipped pm-codex bundle as a self-contained, version-coherent native Codex plugin, make supported plugin components and install behavior accurate, and define the separate Apps SDK architecture required for ChatGPT web and public plugin distribution."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Feature"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["apps-sdk","area:plugins","chatgpt","codex","distribution","mcp","roadmap"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-11T11:10:40.136Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-11T11:10:40.136Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex-native-plugin-research"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":720},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Cached marketplace installs load a self-contained MCP runtime whose version matches the installed plugin without an npx-at-latest startup dependency; only documented plugin components are shipped or claimed; manifest, marketplace, assets, legal metadata, skills, and MCP configuration validate against the then-current official OpenAI contract; cache-layout and fresh-session smokes prove skills and MCP tools load; the ChatGPT lane is resolved by an explicit architecture decision and, if selected, a reachable MCP app with exact tool schemas, output schemas, safety annotations, authentication/privacy controls, developer-mode proof, submission tests, and documented surface support; implementation starts only after explicit approval."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"A trustworthy plugin whose native Codex behavior, ChatGPT reach, runtime packaging, permissions, and public distribution claims match the official OpenAI contracts."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"Official plugin and Apps SDK documentation changed materially in 2026, while the cached pm-codex runtime still falls back to npx at latest and the public docs conflate a local Codex bundle with a ChatGPT app."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-doxj"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"pm-codex has an evidence-backed local Codex implementation and an explicit, independently validated path for any ChatGPT app or public plugin scope."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"plugins/pm-codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-11T11:10:40.136Z","author":"codex-native-plugin-research","text":"Duplicate-check evidence 2026-07-11: pm context, list-open, list-in-progress, and all-status searches for native codex plugin, pm-codex Apps SDK, ChatGPT Codex plugin official docs, Codex plugin npx fallback cache, and native ChatGPT plugin found the closed shipped lineage pm-0c9q/pm-d97r plus Claude-only pm-l9wl/pm-dudr, but no item covering current OpenAI plugin and Apps SDK alignment. This feature extends rather than reopens the completed May implementation."}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"8dacf1205959d6bfeaaee9ecf50cc7350be8bc0029c20d4b24b1a416f6ad46ae","message":""}
